+    """Remember only a host-owned tools.set invalidation, never a new grant.
+
+    The old agent and durable row keep their old digest and remain unusable.
+    This proof only prevents an intentionally invalidated session from being
+    mistaken for a current session when an independent global model is saved.
+    The tools.set owner holds all registry/history/authority locks, acquired
+    non-blockingly before its config write; do not reacquire non-reentrant locks.
+    """
